#. 痛い…苗木クンの言葉が痛い！
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You wound me, Makoto! Words can cut as deep as any\n"
"blade, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの発言邪魔してくれちゃって…！
#. ペナルティだからね！
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You interrupted me while I was talking! One point\n"
"deduction!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

