"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの致命傷は、
#. 全身にあった数多くの傷だったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro died from the wounds she had all over her body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこに…謎を解く手掛かりがあるのかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's got to be some sort of explanation that can\n"
"solve this mystery...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの致命傷は、
